atentImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [270, 106], "pos": [1432.6683349609375, 1088.9742431640625], "id": 23, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.8.2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"batch_size": true, "width": true, "height": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyFlux2LatentImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [15], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["东亚美少女, UHD, 这是一个捕捉自然治愈力与精神世界的超写实摄影。场景设定在盛夏时分的一处开阔草坡，由于微风吹过，半米高的翠绿野草呈现出如同波浪般起伏的动态。少女穿着一件简单的白色棉麻吊带裙，正仰卧在草丛深处，身边堆放着几本翻开的诗集。她正专注地读书，几朵白色与黄色的雏菊恰好生长在她的耳边，随风轻轻摩擦她的侧脸。光影采用了由于云层滤过而形成的柔和自然光，消解了阴影，使皮肤呈现出如陶瓷般的哑光质感。前景是微距下虚化的草尖，细节处能看到一颗透明的露珠。后景是逐渐模糊的远方山脊线和几朵静止的积云。色彩基调以清新的翠绿、纯白与蔚蓝为主，传达出一种与自然完全融合、极致宁静且富有生命力的小确幸。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [461.4712219238281, 388.2081604003906], "pos": [1405.2430419921875, 595.1373291015625], "id": 16, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["```\n欢迎进入我的主页\nQQ交流群：821194069\n可定制工作流和模型和远程部署！\n\n```\n---\n\n### 公众号直达：[AIGC特异点](https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HPH9c0lymUxKDipVcw7PCQ)👈\n### B站直达：[AIGC特异点](https://space.bilibili.com/49766729?spm_id_from=333.1007.0.0 )👈\n### 闲鱼店铺直达：[AI服务](https://www.goofish.com/personal?spm=a21ybx.home.nav.1.4c053da6H5SqxH)👈\n### runninghub主页：[AIGC特异点](https://www.runninghub.cn/?inviteCode=sdhs0trb)👈\n### LIBLIBAI主页：[模型Lora](https://www.liblib.art/userpage/4230c933675a4170a1c9e7b42